 assets/posts/doosan-dnm.cps                | 11 +++---
 crates/post/tests/doosan_dnm_post.rs       | 41 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 docs/decisions/4347-dnm-smoothing-cycle.md | 31 ++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 79 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
